{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01997nSi36axCfQEygfpDNMc","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t/* CMU_10: an animation set in my-3D2dge's readable format (written by the tools in tools/; clips may be edited by hand).\n2\t * CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu), free for all uses; created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.\n3\t * 6 clips, 230 key poses. Played by src/mocap/mocap.js with src/mocap/readable.js. \"sources\" holds the proportions\n4\t * each library was measured with; \"fit\" each clip's average and worst body-point error against its capture (mm).\n5\t * my-3D2dge readable clip. Times in seconds; every other number is a whole number. Rig frame: forward, right, up.\n6\t * L and R are the figure's own sides. Directions are percentages and need not add up: [100, 0, 0] and [50, 0, 0] agree.\n7\t * hips   [forward, right, up]   the pelvis, in percent of standing hip height (100 = standing, 55 = sitting on a chair)\n8\t * body   [turn, lean, tilt]     the pelvis, degrees: turn + = toward the right, lean + = forward, tilt + = toward the right\n9\t * chest  [turn, lean, tilt]     the chest, relative to the pelvis        head [turn, lean, tilt]  relative to the chest\n10\t * shL shR    [reach, shrug]     degrees the shoulder swings forward (into a punch or an aim) and up, from rest\n11\t * armL armR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  which way the arm points from the shoulder to the fist, in chest space\n12\t *            (out + = away from the body on that side; [0, 0, -100] hangs down, [100, 0, 0] punches ahead);\n13\t *            bend = elbow bend in degrees (0 = straight); twist = degrees the elbow swings round the arm from its\n14\t *            natural direction (back and down)\n15\t * legL legR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  hip to ankle in pelvis space; bend: the knee; twist: from pointing forward\n16\t * footL footR [down, out, toes]   degrees the foot points down from standing, turns outward, and the toes bend up\n17\t * blade  [forward, right, up]   (sword clips) the direction of a blade held in the right fist, in chest space\n18\t * root   [forward, right]       (clips that travel) how far the whole body has moved, in percent of standing hip height\n19\t */\n20\t(window.MOCAP = window.MOCAP || {})[\"CMU_10\"] = {\n21\t\"set\": \"CMU_10\",\n22\t\"title\": \"CMU subject 10\",\n23\t\"format\": 1,\n24\t\"credit\": \"CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu), free for all uses; created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.\",\n25\t\"fps\": 30,\n26\t\"sources\": {\"CMU_10\":{\"file\":\"10.asf\",\"rig\":\"cmu\",\"label\":\"CMU motion capture, subject 10 (kick soccer ball)\",\"origin\":\"CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu)\",\"license\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9eca6c66-8849-4edb-a442-cc89add0a71e","uuid":"89f28be9-77ab-4016-9e52-cbf9dabbd8f9","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:04:00.499Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/.cache/cc-plan-x4394d1/out/cmu10-head.txt","content":"/* CMU_10: an animation set in my-3D2dge's readable format (written by the tools in tools/; clips may be edited by hand).\n * CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu), free for all uses; created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.\n * 6 clips, 230 key poses. Played by src/mocap/mocap.js with src/mocap/readable.js. \"sources\" holds the proportions\n * each library was measured with; \"fit\" each clip's average and worst body-point error against its capture (mm).\n * my-3D2dge readable clip. Times in seconds; every other number is a whole number. Rig frame: forward, right, up.\n * L and R are the figure's own sides. Directions are percentages and need not add up: [100, 0, 0] and [50, 0, 0] agree.\n * hips   [forward, right, up]   the pelvis, in percent of standing hip height (100 = standing, 55 = sitting on a chair)\n * body   [turn, lean, tilt]     the pelvis, degrees: turn + = toward the right, lean + = forward, tilt + = toward the right\n * chest  [turn, lean, tilt]     the chest, relative to the pelvis        head [turn, lean, tilt]  relative to the chest\n * shL shR    [reach, shrug]     degrees the shoulder swings forward (into a punch or an aim) and up, from rest\n * armL armR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  which way the arm points from the shoulder to the fist, in chest space\n *            (out + = away from the body on that side; [0, 0, -100] hangs down, [100, 0, 0] punches ahead);\n *            bend = elbow bend in degrees (0 = straight); twist = degrees the elbow swings round the arm from its\n *            natural direction (back and down)\n * legL legR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  hip to ankle in pelvis space; bend: the knee; twist: from pointing forward\n * footL footR [down, out, toes]   degrees the foot points down from standing, turns outward, and the toes bend up\n * blade  [forward, right, up]   (sword clips) the direction of a blade held in the right fist, in chest space\n * root   [forward, right]       (clips that travel) how far the whole body has moved, in percent of standing hip height\n */\n(window.MOCAP = window.MOCAP || {})[\"CMU_10\"] = {\n\"set\": \"CMU_10\",\n\"title\": \"CMU subject 10\",\n\"format\": 1,\n\"credit\": \"CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu), free for all uses; created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.\",\n\"fps\": 30,\n\"sources\": {\"CMU_10\":{\"file\":\"10.asf\",\"rig\":\"cmu\",\"label\":\"CMU motion capture, subject 10 (kick soccer ball)\",\"origin\":\"CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu)\",\"license\"","numLines":26,"startLine":1,"totalLines":26}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01997nSi36axCfQEygfpDNMc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
