{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0119F5AgPrLdoGVRES8ggAgk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t2137 PLAN.md\n2\tfences: 18\n3\t1:# EUROPHORIA FOOTBALL\n4\t28:## Contents\n5\t49:## 1. The game in one page\n6\t51:### 1.1 Core loop\n7\t60:### 1.2 Pillars\n8\t74:### 1.3 From the source to the mechanics\n9\t91:### 1.4 How long the demo is, and where each mechanic shows up first\n10\t111:## 2. Controls, prompts and devices\n11\t113:### 2.1 Action table\n12\t141:### 2.2 Input preset\n13\t155:### 2.3 Prompts and glyphs\n14\t180:### 2.4 Shared keyboard, controllers joining\n15\t187:### 2.5 Touch-only devices\n16\t197:## 3. Tech stack, folder layout, build\n17\t199:### 3.1 Stack\n18\t220:### 3.2 Folder layout (inside the dev folder)\n19\t245:### 3.3 Build\n20\t273:### 3.4 Environment notes for this machine\n21\t286:## 4. Architecture\n22\t288:### 4.1 Runtime overview\n23\t316:### 4.2 Modules (src fragments, in load order)\n24\t358:### 4.3 Core contracts\n25\t399:### 4.4 Scenes and flow\n26\t422:### 4.5 Simulation, presentation and network roles\n27\t433:### 4.6 Registries: the designers' language\n28\t442:### 4.7 The Game object\n29\t463:## 5. Engine changes\n30\t511:## 6. Systems and mechanics\n31\t516:### 6.1 Pitch and stadium geometry\n32\t537:### 6.2 The ball\n33\t566:### 6.3 Footballers: movement, stamina, dribbling\n34\t581:### 6.4 Passing\n35\t604:### 6.5 Shooting, air moves\n36\t635:### 6.6 Skill moves (`skill`)\n37\t647:### 6.7 Defending\n38\t668:### 6.8 Goalkeepers\n39\t689:### 6.9 Euphoria, Europhoria, Super Strikes, the Save Duel\n40\t727:### 6.10 The referee, fouls, advantage, cards, theatrics, VAR\n41\t757:### 6.11 Set pieces and restarts\n42\t787:### 6.12 Match flow, clock, extra time, shootouts\n43\t805:### 6.13 Team AI, tactics and difficulty\n44\t861:### 6.14 Camera\n45\t880:### 6.15 Action replay\n46\t893:### 6.16 HUD (10-foot)\n47\t917:### 6.17 Commentary\n48\t936:### 6.18 Crowd\n49\t952:### 6.19 Weather, pitch condit