{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh2J1DjY7XypxPfZ7qj6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01H3zpVLeoQQJxk3tcEc85zT","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174834__x4394d1/work/PLAN.md","offset":1241,"limit":28},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2068,"cache_read_input_tokens":452741,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2068},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9eca6c66-8849-4edb-a442-cc89add0a71e","uuid":"81558c0a-1527-422e-9340-c23d82187209","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:30:42.210Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh2Hzws7ycPfPiadyMe7","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01H3zpVLeoQQJxk3tcEc85zT":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174834__x4394d1/work/PLAN.md","offset":1241,"limit":28}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H3zpVLeoQQJxk3tcEc85zT","type":"tool_result","content":"1241\t### 6.30 Dev mode\n1242\t\n1243\t- **Reach it:** the pause menu's \"Dev mode\" item, the backquote key (`` ` ``) or F1 in any scene (call\n1244\t  `preventDefault()` on F1's keydown, or Chrome opens its help page), or `?dev=1`. It is never available in AI Hub\n1245\t  sessions. Opening it from the pause menu resumes the game (`game.resume()`) and opens the panel over the running\n1246\t  scene. The panel takes the input while it is open; the match keeps running behind it, with every human's footballer\n1247\t  handed to the CPU, so slider changes can be watched live. A **Freeze** toggle stops the sim instead.\n1248\t- **The panel:** a canvas drawer on the right 40% of the screen, translucent (`E.ui.box` with alpha .9), 4 tabs (L1/R1,\n1249\t  Q/E, or click): TUNE, CHEATS, WARP, INFO. Rows are navigated with the d-pad or stick; left/right changes a value\n1250\t  (holding speeds it up); ✕ toggles or runs; ○, Esc or F1 closes. The mouse hovers, clicks and drags sliders.\n1251\t  - **TUNE:** every `EF.T` slider (Appendix A), grouped (Movement, Ball, Passing & Shooting, Keepers, Defending &\n1252\t    Rules, Euphoria, AI, Match). Each shows its value, its default and a ↺ when changed. At the top: **RESET ALL TO\n1253\t    DEFAULTS**; on each row, □ resets that one. Changes apply at once and are kept in `E.store('ef:tuning')`, so they\n1254\t    survive a reload until reset. A dev-panel badge shows on the HUD while any value differs from its default.\n1255\t  - **CHEATS:** infinite stamina (per side), Euphoria always full (per side), invincible keeper (per side), the CPU\n1256\t    controls everyone (watch mode), \"pure football\" (no Euphoria, supers or events), freeze the clock, a goal for home\n1257\t    / away, set the clock to 44' / 89', slow motion (0.25×) and step one frame (while frozen), show hitboxes and\n1258\t    contact capsules, show the AI (formation spots, roles, the pass lanes it scores, its decision text over the\n1259\t    carrier), show the ball's predicted path and the air-ball window, show `rig.debug` skeletons, mute the crowd.\n1260\t  - **WARP:** go to any scene and part: every deep link (§4.4), each cup round's pre-match beat, half time, extra time,\n1261\t    a shootout, the results, the ending, the album, about; trigger now: a corner, a free kick, a penalty, a matchday\n1262\t    event (pick one), a super strike, a Save Duel, a foul with a yellow or a red, a dive, VAR, a celebration (pick\n1263\t    one), a replay; unlock everything (the cup's rounds, stickers, balls); reset the save.\n1264\t  - **INFO:** the version and build, the seed, the scene and mode, `game.debug.snapshot()` pretty-printed, counts\n1265\t    (bodies, particles, fans, lights, rigs drawn), the frame time (`game.stats`), the hub role when relevant.\n1266\t- Dev mode never changes a save unless WARP's unlock or reset is used (it asks first, with its own confirm row).\n1267\t\n1268\t### 6.31 Saves, settings, unlocks, stickers"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9eca6c66-8849-4edb-a442-cc89add0a71e","uuid":"32a2b430-15fc-4d70-9144-1534dd708a0d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:30:42.216Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174834__x4394d1/work/PLAN.md","content":"### 6.30 Dev mode\n\n- **Reach it:** the pause menu's \"Dev mode\" item, the backquote key (`` ` ``) or F1 in any scene (call\n  `preventDefault()` on F1's keydown, or Chrome opens its help page), or `?dev=1`. It is never available in AI Hub\n  sessions. Opening it from the pause menu resumes the game (`game.resume()`) and opens the panel over the running\n  scene. The panel takes the input while it is open; the match keeps running behind it, with every human's footballer\n  handed to the CPU, so slider changes can be watched live. A **Freeze** toggle stops the sim instead.\n- **The panel:** a canvas drawer on the right 40% of the screen, translucent (`E.ui.box` with alpha .9), 4 tabs (L1/R1,\n  Q/E, or click): TUNE, CHEATS, WARP, INFO. Rows are navigated with the d-pad or stick; left/right changes a value\n  (holding speeds it up); ✕ toggles or runs; ○, Esc or F1 closes. The mouse hovers, clicks and drags sliders.\n  - **TUNE:** every `EF.T` slider (Appendix A), grouped (Movement, Ball, Passing & Shooting, Keepers, Defending &\n    Rules, Euphoria, AI, Match). Each shows its value, its default and a ↺ when changed. At the top: **RESET ALL TO\n    DEFAULTS**; on each row, □ resets that one. Changes apply at once and are kept in `E.store('ef:tuning')`, so they\n    survive a reload until reset. A dev-panel badge shows on the HUD while any value differs from its default.\n  - **CHEATS:** infinite stamina (per side), Euphoria always full (per side), invincible keeper (per side), the CPU\n    controls everyone (watch mode), \"pure football\" (no Euphoria, supers or events), freeze the clock, a goal for home\n    / away, set the clock to 44' / 89', slow motion (0.25×) and step one frame (while frozen), show hitboxes and\n    contact capsules, show the AI (formation spots, roles, the pass lanes it scores, its decision text over the\n    carrier), show the ball's predicted path and the air-ball window, show `rig.debug` skeletons, mute the crowd.\n  - **WARP:** go to any scene and part: every deep link (§4.4), each cup round's pre-match beat, half time, extra time,\n    a shootout, the results, the ending, the album, about; trigger now: a corner, a free kick, a penalty, a matchday\n    event (pick one), a super strike, a Save Duel, a foul with a yellow or a red, a dive, VAR, a celebration (pick\n    one), a replay; unlock everything (the cup's rounds, stickers, balls); reset the save.\n  - **INFO:** the version and build, the seed, the scene and mode, `game.debug.snapshot()` pretty-printed, counts\n    (bodies, particles, fans, lights, rigs drawn), the frame time (`game.stats`), the hub role when relevant.\n- Dev mode never changes a save unless WARP's unlock or reset is used (it asks first, with its own confirm row).\n\n### 6.31 Saves, settings, unlocks, stickers","numLines":28,"startLine":1241,"totalLines":2138}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01H3zpVLeoQQJxk3tcEc85zT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
