{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Nv761KkYWQaenL1uzhncSq","type":"tool_result","content":"1990\t   mocap clips through Mocap.drive and new procedural moves (body tilt)\"; Audio \"the engine's chip synth for music and\n1991\t   SFX, plus a WebAudio crowd engine, sung chants and Animalese-style babble voices; no audio files\"; Online \"AI Hub\n1992\t   Session Protocol v1, shared-world, 2–4 players\"; Testing, Research, Environment (\"Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux;\n1993\t   browser unknown\" unless known), Model, Usage: fill in from the build.\n1994\t3. Rebuild so the About pages carry the same text (§3.3), and rerun the `browser` suite.\n1995\t4. Reply in chat with the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback (the same answers as\n1996\t   the JSON), and a short summary.\n1997\t\n1998\t---\n1999\t\n2000\t## Appendix A: tuning defaults (dev sliders)\n2001\t\n2002\t| Key | Default | Min | Max | Step | Group | What it does |\n2003\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n2004\t| `runSpeed` | 88 | 60 | 130 | 1 | Movement | base run speed (u/s), before the pace stat |\n2005\t| `sprintMul` | 1.45 | 1.1 | 2.0 | .05 | Movement | sprint multiplier |\n2006\t| `accel` | 900 | 300 | 2000 | 50 | Movement | acceleration (u/s²) |\n2007\t| `staminaDrain` | 20 | 5 | 50 | 1 | Movement | per second of sprint |\n2008\t| `staminaRegen` | 14 | 5 | 40 | 1 | Movement | per second at rest |\n2009\t| `ballFriction` | 1.1 | .3 | 3 | .05 | Ball | rolling decay on grass |\n2010\t| `ballBounce` | .55 | .1 | .9 | .05 | Ball | restitution on grass |\n2011\t| `ballGravity` | 600 | 300 | 1000 | 10 | Ball | |\n2012\t| `trapSpeed` | 210 | 120 | 320 | 5 | Ball | the fastest ball trapped at 9 units |\n2013\t| `passSpeedMin` | 150 | 80 | 250 | 5 | Passing & Shooting | |\n2014\t| `passSpeedMax` | 300 | 200 | 450 | 5 | Passing & Shooting | |\n2015\t| `passAssistDeg` | 70 | 0 | 90 | 5 | Passing & Shooting | the High pass-assist cone |\n2016\t| `shotChargeTime` | .8 | .3 | 2 | .05 | Passing & Shooting | seconds to full power |\n2017\t| `shotSpeedMax` | 420 | 250 | 600 | 10 | Passing & Shooting | |\n2018\t| `curlStrength` | 3.2 | 0 | 8 | .1 | Passing & Shooting | aftertouch spin per second |\n2019\t| `keeperReaction` | .18 | .05 | .5 | .01 | Keepers | seconds |\n2020\t| `keeperReach` | 48 | 24 | 80 | 1 | Keepers | lateral dive reach |\n2021\t| `tackleReach` | 9 | 4 | 16 | .5 | Defending & Rules | |\n2022\t| `slideSpeed` | 190 | 100 | 300 | 5 | Defending & Rules | |\n2023\t| `foulStrictness` | 1 | 0 | 2 | .05 | Defending & Rules | × the referee's own |\n2024\t| `diveSuccess` | 1 | 0 | 2 | .05 | Defending & Rules | × the referee's gullibility |\n2025\t| `euphoriaGain` | 1 | 0 | 4 | .1 | Euphoria | × every gain |\n2026\t| `euphoriaDecay` | 1.5 | 0 | 6 | .1 | Euphoria | per second |\n2027\t| `europhoriaTime` | 8 | 3 | 20 | .5 | Euphoria | seconds |\n2028\t| `superSpeed` | 520 | 300 | 800 | 10 | Euphoria | |\n2029\t| `aiReaction` | .25 | .05 | .8 | .01 | AI | seconds between decisions (Normal; difficulty scales it) |\n2030\t| `aiAccuracy` | .8 | .3 | 1 | .05 | AI | |\n2031\t| `aiAggression` | .5 | 0 | 1 | .05 | AI | |\n2032\t| `halfLength` | 120 | 20 | 300 | 10 | Match | real seconds (Settings sets it; the slider overrides it while changed) |\n2033\t| `gameSpeed` | 1 | .25 | 2 | .05 | Match | `game.timeScale` |\n2034\t\n2035\t## Appendix B: network messages\n2036\t\n2037\tAll JSON. Numbers rounded (positions to integers, angles in hundredths of a radian).\n2038\t\n2039\t- **Client → host, `i` (input), unreliable, 15/s:**\n2040\t  `{ t: 'i', s: seq, at: Math.round(AIHub.time()), m: [mx100, my100], a: [ax100, ay100] | 0, h: heldBits, c: [pass, shoot, lob, through, skill, sw, dive, euphoria] }`.\n2041\t  `heldBits`: 1 sprint, 2 pass, 4 shoot, 8 lob, 16 through, 32 skill, 64 sw, 128 dive. `c` holds cumulative press\n2042\t  counts since the round started: the host takes `c[k] > last[k]` as a press, so a lost packet loses no presses. The\n2043\t  host keeps the newest by `s`.\n2044\t- **Client → host, reliable, rare:** `{ t: 'duel', id, at }` (the Save Duel press, in `AIHub.time()` ms);\n2045\t  `{ t: 'cel', k: 0..3 }` (the celebration pick); `{ t: 'menu', open: true|false }` (the settings overlay: the host\n2046\t  gives that footballer to the CPU while open).\n2047\t- **Host → all, `s` (snapshot), unreliable, 14/s, under 1,100 bytes:**\n2048\t  `{ t: 's', n, at, b: [x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, spin100, owner], p: [[x, y, z, vx, vy, f100, st, act, u100, flags], ×10],\n2049\t  r: [x, y, f100, st], m: [mode, clock10, minute, s0, s1, eu0, eu1, euSide, euT10, setpiece], c: [[hubId, footballerIdx], ...] }`.\n2050\t  `st` and `act` are small integer codes from a shared table; `flags` packs cards, glow, human-held and down.\n2051\t- **Host → all, `E` (events), reliable, at most 5/s:** `{ t: 'E', n, list: [[eventSeq, at, type, data], ...] }`,\n2052\t  coalescing the events of up to 200 ms: goal, whistle, card, VAR, commentary line ids (so every copy shows the same\n2053\t  lines), sfx cues, the super strike's start, the duel's start, celebrations, set-piece starts, half time, full time.\n2054\t  Clients apply each `eventSeq` once, in order.\n2055\t- **Host → all, last:** a reliable `s` with `over: 1`, then `AIHub.finish(...)`.\n2056\t\n2057\t## Appendix C: data shapes\n2058\t\n2059\t```js\n2060\tEF.def('team', 'kipperton', { name: 'KIPPERTON ATHLETIC', short: 'KIP', nick: 'THE KIPPERS', city: 'KIPPERTON',\n2061\t  stadium: 'smokehouse', formation: '2-1-1', tactic: 'plucky', chant: 'kipperton', celebration: 'fishslap',\n2062\t  crowd: { factor: 1 }, manager: 'mags',\n2063\t  kits: { home: { shirt: '#f08a24', color2: '#1c2a5a', pattern: 'hoops', shorts: '#1c2a5a', socks: '#f08a24', number: '#ffffff' },\n2064\t          away: { shirt: '#eef0f4', color2: '#f08a24', pattern: 'sash', shorts: '#eef0f4', socks: '#1c2a5a', number: '#1c2a5a' },\n2065\t          keeper: { shirt: '#3ac06a', color2: '#1a5a30', pattern: 'plain', shorts: '#1a1a1a', socks: '#3ac06a', glove: '#f4f4f0' } },\n2066\t  crest: { shape: 'shield', field: '#1c2a5a', ring: '#f08a24', charges: ['kipper', 'anchor'] },\n2067\t  players: [\n2068\t    { id: 'crabb', name: 'WALLY CRABB', num: 1, pos: 'GK', build: 'bulky', size: 1.2, hair: 'bald', skin: '#e0b090', hairColor: '#c8c8c8',\n2069\t      stats: { pace: 60, shoot: 30, pass: 55, tackle: 40, skill: 20, keep: 76, weight: 80, temper: 30 }, voice: { f0: 120, wave: 'pulse' } },\n2070\t    { id: 'pilchard', name: 'DAZ PILCHARD', num: 9, pos: 'FWD', captain: true, super: 'smoked-kipper', build: 'heroic', size: 1.15,\n2071\t      hair: 'short', skin: '#f0c8a8', hairColor: '#5a3a22', stats: { pace: 80, shoot: 90, pass: 70, tackle: 45, skill: 75, keep: 10, weight: 60, temper: 50 },\n2072\t      voice: { f0: 150, wave: 'saw' }, celebration: 'fishslap' } /* ...3 more */ ] });\n2073\t\n2074\tEF.def('formation', '1-2-1', { roles: {\n2075\t  GK: { base: [.03, .5], keeper: true },\n2076\t  DEF: { base: [.22, .5], att: [.14, 0], def: [0, 0], pull: [.45, .55], uRange: [.08, .62] },\n2077\t  MIDL: { base: [.42, .28], att: [.12, -.06], def: [-.12, .04], pull: [.55, .45], uRange: [.15, .85] },\n2078\t  MIDR: { base: [.42, .72], att: [.12, .06], def: [-.12, -.04], pull: [.55, .45], uRange: [.15, .85] },\n2079\t  FWD: { base: [.64, .5], att: [.18, 0], def: [-.12, 0], pull: [.5, .6], uRange: [.35, .95] } }, drop: 'MIDR' });\n2080\t\n2081\tEF.def('tactic', 'keepball', { press: .55, pressers: 1, line: .5, width: .6, tempo: .85, passRisk: .2, shortBias: .9,\n2082\t  longBall: .05, dribble: .25, skill: .3, shootRange: 170, shootBias: .8, foul: .1, dive: .1, euphoriaUse: 'attack', gimmick: 'keepball' });\n2083\t\n2084\tEF.def('referee', 'severo', { name: 'SERGIO SEVERO', strictness: 1.2, gullibility: .7, varHappy: .9, voice: { f0: 135, wave: 'saw' } });\n2085\t\n2086\tEF.def('stadium', 'smokehouse', { name: 'THE SMOKEHOUSE', city: 'KIPPERTON', capacity: 3112, time: 'dusk',\n2087\t  weather: { kind: 'rain', amount: .7, wind: .4 }, surface: 'wet', mud: [[.06, .5, 40], [.94, .5, 40]], puddles: 6,\n2088\t  grass: ['#3f7a34', '#4a8a3c'], wear: .6, lines: '#e8ece0',\n2089\t  stands: { north: { tiers: 3, roof: 'corrugated', seats: '#3a3a48' }, west: { tiers: 2, kind: 'terrace' }, east: { tiers: 2, kind: 'terrace' } },\n2090\t  crowd: { size: 600, home: .8 }, skyline: [['chimney', .12, 90, { smoke: true }], ['lighthouse', .85, 120, { beam: true }]],\n2091\t  lights: { ambient: .55, floodlights: 4, color: '#fff0d0' }, boards: [\"SMOKY JOE'S KIPPERS\", 'GULL INSURANCE: WE COVER EVERYTHING', 'PIE-O-MATIC'],\n2092\t  events: ['seagull', 'floodlight', 'invader-keith'], music: null });\n2093\t\n2094\tEF.def('super', 'smoked-kipper', { name: 'THE SMOKED KIPPER', path: 'wobble', params: { amp: 18, freq: 7 }, trail: 'smoke',\n2095\t  color: '#f08a24', ball: 'kipper', sfx: 'super-kipper', lines: 'super-kipper' });\n2096\t\n2097\tEF.def('celebration', 'kneeslide', { name: 'KNEE SLIDE', clip: 'Slide_Loop', proc: 'armsOut', travel: { speed: 120, t: 1.1 },\n2098\t  euphoria: 8, crowd: 'roar' });\n2099\t\n2100\tEF.def('event', 'seagull', { stadiums: ['smokehouse'], chance: .6, when: { minute: [10, 80], ballLoose: true, notSetPiece: true },\n2101\t  start(m) { /* spawn the gull on the ball */ }, update(m, dt) { /* pin the ball; flee when a player is within 10 */ return done; },\n2102\t  lines: 'event-seagull' });\n2103\t\n2104\tEF.def('drill', 'passing', { title: 'PASS MASTER', coach: 'mags', stadium: 'rec', teaches: ['pass', 'through', 'oneTwo'],\n2105\t  setup(m) { /* two teammates, cones */ },\n2106\t  steps: [ { say: ['Five passes. Feet, not faces.'], goal: { event: 'passDone', count: 5 } },\n2107\t           { say: ['Now a through ball. Into space.'], goal: { event: 'passDone', where: { kind: 'through' }, count: 2 } },\n2108\t           { say: ['One-two. Give it and go.'], goal: { event: 'passDone', where: { kind: 'oneTwo' }, count: 1 } } ],\n2109\t  reward: { sticker: null } });\n2110\t\n2111\tEF.def('beat', 'r2-pre', { round: 2, steps: [\n2112\t  { kind: 'travel', to: 'solera', postcard: \"WISH YOU WERE HERE (IT'S HOT)\" },\n2113\t  { kind: 'tabloid', headline: 'PASS THE PARCEL', sub: 'Kippers must stop the passing masters... if they can find the ball.',\n2114\t    photo: { team: 'pasapasa', player: 'pasarela', pose: 'hips', expr: 'smile' } },\n2115\t  { kind: 'talk', lines: [['pasarela', 'You will chase the ball until you are dizzy, little fishes.']] },\n2116\t  { kind: 'teamtalk' }, { kind: 'challenge', id: 'recover5' }, { kind: 'tunnel' }, { kind: 'match' } ] });\n2117\t\n2118\tEF.lines('goal', [\n2119\t  { who: 'barry', text: 'OH, YOU BEAUTY! {$player} has absolutely LEATHERED it!' },\n2120\t  { who: 'barry', text: 'GET IN! Back of the net from {$player}!', reply: { who: 'trev', text: 'Keeper had no chance. None. Nada. Zilch.' } },\n2121\t  { who: 'barry', text: 'OH MY COD! KIPPERTON HAVE SCORED!', when: m => m.lastGoal.team === 'kipperton' } ]);\n2122\t```\n2123\t\n2124\t## Appendix D: music sketches\n2125\t\n2126\tStarting points in the engine's song format (`audio.music(song)`); refine by ear. All of them are original.\n2127\t\n2128\t**`anthem`** (108 bpm, `steps: 2`, so each token is an eighth note; 8 bars, then loop):\n2129\t\n2130\t```js\n2131\t{ bpm: 108, steps: 2, tracks: [\n2132\t  { name: 'lead', wave: 'pulse', vol: .12, notes:\n2133\t    'G4 - C5 - E5 - G5 - | F5 - E5 D5 E5 - C5 - | A4 - D5 - F5 - A5 - | G5 - - - - - . . | E5 - G5 - C6 - B5 A5 | G5 - E5 - F5 - D5 - | C5 - E5 D5 C5 - B4 - | C5 - - - - - . .' },\n2134\t  { name: 'counter', wave: 'square', vol: .06, notes:\n2135\t    'E4 - E4 - G4 - C5 - | C5 - C5 B4 C5 - A4 - | F4 - F4 - A4 - D5 - | D5 - - - B4 - . . | C5 - E5 - G5 - G5 F5 | E5 - C5 - D5 - B4 - | A4 - C5 B4 A4 - G4 - | E4 - - - - - . .' },\n2136\t  { name: 'bass', wave: 'triangle', vol: .3, notes:\n2137\t    'C3 . G2 . C3 . G2 . | F2 . C3 . F2 . C3 . | D3 . A2 . D3 . A2 . | G2 . D3 . G2 . B2 . | C3 . G2 . E3 . C3 . | F2 . A2 . G2 . B2 . | A2 . F2 . G2 . G2 . | C3 . G2 . C3 . . .' },\n2138\t  { name: 'drums', wave: 'drums', vol: .1, notes: 'k . h . s . h . | k . h k s . h h' } ] }\n2139\t```\n2140\t\n2141\t- **`europhoria`** (a layer, 140 bpm, `steps: 4`): drums `k . h k s . h . | k k h . s . h k`; bass on C2 and G2 in\n2142\t  sixteenths; brass stabs (saw, short `gate: .4`) on the off-beats: `. . C5 . . . E5 . | . . G5 . . . E5 .`. Start it\n2143\t  with the tracks `on: false` and bring them in with `audio.layer(name, 1, .4)` when Europhoria starts.\n2144\t- **`tension`** (60 bpm): a held minor chord (3 triangle tracks: A3, C4, E4, each `-` held over 4 bars); a kick on\n2145\t  each beat as the heartbeat (`k . . . k . . .` at `steps: 2`, the second kick soft).\n2146\t- **Kipperton chant** (a chant entry, 120 bpm): syllables `KIP PER TON` on `G4 G4 C5`, vowels `i e o`, then 3 claps;\n2147\t  repeated twice, then `WE'RE GO-ING UP THE COAST` on the anthem's first phrase.\n2148\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9eca6c66-8849-4edb-a442-cc89add0a71e","uuid":"0ae5b95b-7f60-494b-aaa9-5cb063fe9ead","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:32:53.964Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174834__x4394d1/work/PLAN.md","content":"   mocap clips through Mocap.drive and new procedural moves (body tilt)\"; Audio \"the engine's chip synth for music and\n   SFX, plus a WebAudio crowd engine, sung chants and Animalese-style babble voices; no audio files\"; Online \"AI Hub\n   Session Protocol v1, shared-world, 2–4 players\"; Testing, Research, Environment (\"Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux;\n   browser unknown\" unless known), Model, Usage: fill in from the build.\n3. Rebuild so the About pages carry the same text (§3.3), and rerun the `browser` suite.\n4. Reply in chat with the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback (the same answers as\n   the JSON), and a short summary.\n\n---\n\n## Appendix A: tuning defaults (dev sliders)\n\n| Key | Default | Min | Max | Step | Group | What it does |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `runSpeed` | 88 | 60 | 130 | 1 | Movement | base run speed (u/s), before the pace stat |\n| `sprintMul` | 1.45 | 1.1 | 2.0 | .05 | Movement | sprint multiplier |\n| `accel` | 900 | 300 | 2000 | 50 | Movement | acceleration (u/s²) |\n| `staminaDrain` | 20 | 5 | 50 | 1 | Movement | per second of sprint |\n| `staminaRegen` | 14 | 5 | 40 | 1 | Movement | per second at rest |\n| `ballFriction` | 1.1 | .3 | 3 | .05 | Ball | rolling decay on grass |\n| `ballBounce` | .55 | .1 | .9 | .05 | Ball | restitution on grass |\n| `ballGravity` | 600 | 300 | 1000 | 10 | Ball | |\n| `trapSpeed` | 210 | 120 | 320 | 5 | Ball | the fastest ball trapped at 9 units |\n| `passSpeedMin` | 150 | 80 | 250 | 5 | Passing & Shooting | |\n| `passSpeedMax` | 300 | 200 | 450 | 5 | Passing & Shooting | |\n| `passAssistDeg` | 70 | 0 | 90 | 5 | Passing & Shooting | the High pass-assist cone |\n| `shotChargeTime` | .8 | .3 | 2 | .05 | Passing & Shooting | seconds to full power |\n| `shotSpeedMax` | 420 | 250 | 600 | 10 | Passing & Shooting | |\n| `curlStrength` | 3.2 | 0 | 8 | .1 | Passing & Shooting | aftertouch spin per second |\n| `keeperReaction` | .18 | .05 | .5 | .01 | Keepers | seconds |\n| `keeperReach` | 48 | 24 | 80 | 1 | Keepers | lateral dive reach |\n| `tackleReach` | 9 | 4 | 16 | .5 | Defending & Rules | |\n| `slideSpeed` | 190 | 100 | 300 | 5 | Defending & Rules | |\n| `foulStrictness` | 1 | 0 | 2 | .05 | Defending & Rules | × the referee's own |\n| `diveSuccess` | 1 | 0 | 2 | .05 | Defending & Rules | × the referee's gullibility |\n| `euphoriaGain` | 1 | 0 | 4 | .1 | Euphoria | × every gain |\n| `euphoriaDecay` | 1.5 | 0 | 6 | .1 | Euphoria | per second |\n| `europhoriaTime` | 8 | 3 | 20 | .5 | Euphoria | seconds |\n| `superSpeed` | 520 | 300 | 800 | 10 | Euphoria | |\n| `aiReaction` | .25 | .05 | .8 | .01 | AI | seconds between decisions (Normal; difficulty scales it) |\n| `aiAccuracy` | .8 | .3 | 1 | .05 | AI | |\n| `aiAggression` | .5 | 0 | 1 | .05 | AI | |\n| `halfLength` | 120 | 20 | 300 | 10 | Match | real seconds (Settings sets it; the slider overrides it while changed) |\n| `gameSpeed` | 1 | .25 | 2 | .05 | Match | `game.timeScale` |\n\n## Appendix B: network messages\n\nAll JSON. Numbers rounded (positions to integers, angles in hundredths of a radian).\n\n- **Client → host, `i` (input), unreliable, 15/s:**\n  `{ t: 'i', s: seq, at: Math.round(AIHub.time()), m: [mx100, my100], a: [ax100, ay100] | 0, h: heldBits, c: [pass, shoot, lob, through, skill, sw, dive, euphoria] }`.\n  `heldBits`: 1 sprint, 2 pass, 4 shoot, 8 lob, 16 through, 32 skill, 64 sw, 128 dive. `c` holds cumulative press\n  counts since the round started: the host takes `c[k] > last[k]` as a press, so a lost packet loses no presses. The\n  host keeps the newest by `s`.\n- **Client → host, reliable, rare:** `{ t: 'duel', id, at }` (the Save Duel press, in `AIHub.time()` ms);\n  `{ t: 'cel', k: 0..3 }` (the celebration pick); `{ t: 'menu', open: true|false }` (the settings overlay: the host\n  gives that footballer to the CPU while open).\n- **Host → all, `s` (snapshot), unreliable, 14/s, under 1,100 bytes:**\n  `{ t: 's', n, at, b: [x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, spin100, owner], p: [[x, y, z, vx, vy, f100, st, act, u100, flags], ×10],\n  r: [x, y, f100, st], m: [mode, clock10, minute, s0, s1, eu0, eu1, euSide, euT10, setpiece], c: [[hubId, footballerIdx], ...] }`.\n  `st` and `act` are small integer codes from a shared table; `flags` packs cards, glow, human-held and down.\n- **Host → all, `E` (events), reliable, at most 5/s:** `{ t: 'E', n, list: [[eventSeq, at, type, data], ...] }`,\n  coalescing the events of up to 200 ms: goal, whistle, card, VAR, commentary line ids (so every copy shows the same\n  lines), sfx cues, the super strike's start, the duel's start, celebrations, set-piece starts, half time, full time.\n  Clients apply each `eventSeq` once, in order.\n- **Host → all, last:** a reliable `s` with `over: 1`, then `AIHub.finish(...)`.\n\n## Appendix C: data shapes\n\n```js\nEF.def('team', 'kipperton', { name: 'KIPPERTON ATHLETIC', short: 'KIP', nick: 'THE KIPPERS', city: 'KIPPERTON',\n  stadium: 'smokehouse', formation: '2-1-1', tactic: 'plucky', chant: 'kipperton', celebration: 'fishslap',\n  crowd: { factor: 1 }, manager: 'mags',\n  kits: { home: { shirt: '#f08a24', color2: '#1c2a5a', pattern: 'hoops', shorts: '#1c2a5a', socks: '#f08a24', number: '#ffffff' },\n          away: { shirt: '#eef0f4', color2: '#f08a24', pattern: 'sash', shorts: '#eef0f4', socks: '#1c2a5a', number: '#1c2a5a' },\n          keeper: { shirt: '#3ac06a', color2: '#1a5a30', pattern: 'plain', shorts: '#1a1a1a', socks: '#3ac06a', glove: '#f4f4f0' } },\n  crest: { shape: 'shield', field: '#1c2a5a', ring: '#f08a24', charges: ['kipper', 'anchor'] },\n  players: [\n    { id: 'crabb', name: 'WALLY CRABB', num: 1, pos: 'GK', build: 'bulky', size: 1.2, hair: 'bald', skin: '#e0b090', hairColor: '#c8c8c8',\n      stats: { pace: 60, shoot: 30, pass: 55, tackle: 40, skill: 20, keep: 76, weight: 80, temper: 30 }, voice: { f0: 120, wave: 'pulse' } },\n    { id: 'pilchard', name: 'DAZ PILCHARD', num: 9, pos: 'FWD', captain: true, super: 'smoked-kipper', build: 'heroic', size: 1.15,\n      hair: 'short', skin: '#f0c8a8', hairColor: '#5a3a22', stats: { pace: 80, shoot: 90, pass: 70, tackle: 45, skill: 75, keep: 10, weight: 60, temper: 50 },\n      voice: { f0: 150, wave: 'saw' }, celebration: 'fishslap' } /* ...3 more */ ] });\n\nEF.def('formation', '1-2-1', { roles: {\n  GK: { base: [.03, .5], keeper: true },\n  DEF: { base: [.22, .5], att: [.14, 0], def: [0, 0], pull: [.45, .55], uRange: [.08, .62] },\n  MIDL: { base: [.42, .28], att: [.12, -.06], def: [-.12, .04], pull: [.55, .45], uRange: [.15, .85] },\n  MIDR: { base: [.42, .72], att: [.12, .06], def: [-.12, -.04], pull: [.55, .45], uRange: [.15, .85] },\n  FWD: { base: [.64, .5], att: [.18, 0], def: [-.12, 0], pull: [.5, .6], uRange: [.35, .95] } }, drop: 'MIDR' });\n\nEF.def('tactic', 'keepball', { press: .55, pressers: 1, line: .5, width: .6, tempo: .85, passRisk: .2, shortBias: .9,\n  longBall: .05, dribble: .25, skill: .3, shootRange: 170, shootBias: .8, foul: .1, dive: .1, euphoriaUse: 'attack', gimmick: 'keepball' });\n\nEF.def('referee', 'severo', { name: 'SERGIO SEVERO', strictness: 1.2, gullibility: .7, varHappy: .9, voice: { f0: 135, wave: 'saw' } });\n\nEF.def('stadium', 'smokehouse', { name: 'THE SMOKEHOUSE', city: 'KIPPERTON', capacity: 3112, time: 'dusk',\n  weather: { kind: 'rain', amount: .7, wind: .4 }, surface: 'wet', mud: [[.06, .5, 40], [.94, .5, 40]], puddles: 6,\n  grass: ['#3f7a34', '#4a8a3c'], wear: .6, lines: '#e8ece0',\n  stands: { north: { tiers: 3, roof: 'corrugated', seats: '#3a3a48' }, west: { tiers: 2, kind: 'terrace' }, east: { tiers: 2, kind: 'terrace' } },\n  crowd: { size: 600, home: .8 }, skyline: [['chimney', .12, 90, { smoke: true }], ['lighthouse', .85, 120, { beam: true }]],\n  lights: { ambient: .55, floodlights: 4, color: '#fff0d0' }, boards: [\"SMOKY JOE'S KIPPERS\", 'GULL INSURANCE: WE COVER EVERYTHING', 'PIE-O-MATIC'],\n  events: ['seagull', 'floodlight', 'invader-keith'], music: null });\n\nEF.def('super', 'smoked-kipper', { name: 'THE SMOKED KIPPER', path: 'wobble', params: { amp: 18, freq: 7 }, trail: 'smoke',\n  color: '#f08a24', ball: 'kipper', sfx: 'super-kipper', lines: 'super-kipper' });\n\nEF.def('celebration', 'kneeslide', { name: 'KNEE SLIDE', clip: 'Slide_Loop', proc: 'armsOut', travel: { speed: 120, t: 1.1 },\n  euphoria: 8, crowd: 'roar' });\n\nEF.def('event', 'seagull', { stadiums: ['smokehouse'], chance: .6, when: { minute: [10, 80], ballLoose: true, notSetPiece: true },\n  start(m) { /* spawn the gull on the ball */ }, update(m, dt) { /* pin the ball; flee when a player is within 10 */ return done; },\n  lines: 'event-seagull' });\n\nEF.def('drill', 'passing', { title: 'PASS MASTER', coach: 'mags', stadium: 'rec', teaches: ['pass', 'through', 'oneTwo'],\n  setup(m) { /* two teammates, cones */ },\n  steps: [ { say: ['Five passes. Feet, not faces.'], goal: { event: 'passDone', count: 5 } },\n           { say: ['Now a through ball. Into space.'], goal: { event: 'passDone', where: { kind: 'through' }, count: 2 } },\n           { say: ['One-two. Give it and go.'], goal: { event: 'passDone', where: { kind: 'oneTwo' }, count: 1 } } ],\n  reward: { sticker: null } });\n\nEF.def('beat', 'r2-pre', { round: 2, steps: [\n  { kind: 'travel', to: 'solera', postcard: \"WISH YOU WERE HERE (IT'S HOT)\" },\n  { kind: 'tabloid', headline: 'PASS THE PARCEL', sub: 'Kippers must stop the passing masters... if they can find the ball.',\n    photo: { team: 'pasapasa', player: 'pasarela', pose: 'hips', expr: 'smile' } },\n  { kind: 'talk', lines: [['pasarela', 'You will chase the ball until you are dizzy, little fishes.']] },\n  { kind: 'teamtalk' }, { kind: 'challenge', id: 'recover5' }, { kind: 'tunnel' }, { kind: 'match' } ] });\n\nEF.lines('goal', [\n  { who: 'barry', text: 'OH, YOU BEAUTY! {$player} has absolutely LEATHERED it!' },\n  { who: 'barry', text: 'GET IN! Back of the net from {$player}!', reply: { who: 'trev', text: 'Keeper had no chance. None. Nada. Zilch.' } },\n  { who: 'barry', text: 'OH MY COD! KIPPERTON HAVE SCORED!', when: m => m.lastGoal.team === 'kipperton' } ]);\n```\n\n## Appendix D: music sketches\n\nStarting points in the engine's song format (`audio.music(song)`); refine by ear. All of them are original.\n\n**`anthem`** (108 bpm, `steps: 2`, so each token is an eighth note; 8 bars, then loop):\n\n```js\n{ bpm: 108, steps: 2, tracks: [\n  { name: 'lead', wave: 'pulse', vol: .12, notes:\n    'G4 - C5 - E5 - G5 - | F5 - E5 D5 E5 - C5 - | A4 - D5 - F5 - A5 - | G5 - - - - - . . | E5 - G5 - C6 - B5 A5 | G5 - E5 - F5 - D5 - | C5 - E5 D5 C5 - B4 - | C5 - - - - - . .' },\n  { name: 'counter', wave: 'square', vol: .06, notes:\n    'E4 - E4 - G4 - C5 - | C5 - C5 B4 C5 - A4 - | F4 - F4 - A4 - D5 - | D5 - - - B4 - . . | C5 - E5 - G5 - G5 F5 | E5 - C5 - D5 - B4 - | A4 - C5 B4 A4 - G4 - | E4 - - - - - . .' },\n  { name: 'bass', wave: 'triangle', vol: .3, notes:\n    'C3 . G2 . C3 . G2 . | F2 . C3 . F2 . C3 . | D3 . A2 . D3 . A2 . | G2 . D3 . G2 . B2 . | C3 . G2 . E3 . C3 . | F2 . A2 . G2 . B2 . | A2 . F2 . G2 . G2 . | C3 . G2 . C3 . . .' },\n  { name: 'drums', wave: 'drums', vol: .1, notes: 'k . h . s . h . | k . h k s . h h' } ] }\n```\n\n- **`europhoria`** (a layer, 140 bpm, `steps: 4`): drums `k . h k s . h . | k k h . s . h k`; bass on C2 and G2 in\n  sixteenths; brass stabs (saw, short `gate: .4`) on the off-beats: `. . C5 . . . E5 . | . . G5 . . . E5 .`. Start it\n  with the tracks `on: false` and bring them in with `audio.layer(name, 1, .4)` when Europhoria starts.\n- **`tension`** (60 bpm): a held minor chord (3 triangle tracks: A3, C4, E4, each `-` held over 4 bars); a kick on\n  each beat as the heartbeat (`k . . . k . . .` at `steps: 2`, the second kick soft).\n- **Kipperton chant** (a chant entry, 120 bpm): syllables `KIP PER TON` on `G4 G4 C5`, vowels `i e o`, then 3 claps;\n  repeated twice, then `WE'RE GO-ING UP THE COAST` on the anthem's first phrase.\n","numLines":159,"startLine":1990,"totalLines":2148}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Nv761KkYWQaenL1uzhncSq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
